### ==========================================
### HUELLAS DULCES - API DE PRODUCTOS
### ==========================================

### 1. Crear producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galletas de pollo",
  "description": "Snack natural de pollo para perros",
  "category": "Snacks",
  "price": 15000,
  "stock": 20
}

###

### 2. Crear segundo producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hueso de carne",
  "description": "Snack de carne para perros",
  "category": "Snacks",
  "price": 12000,
  "stock": 15
}

###

### 3. Listar todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

###

### 4. Buscar producto por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1

###

### 5. Actualizar producto
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galletas de pollo premium",
  "description": "Snack natural premium de pollo para perros",
  "category": "Snacks Premium",
  "price": 18000,
  "stock": 25
}

###

### 6. Buscar producto inexistente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/999

###

### 7. Intentar crear producto inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "price": -5000,
  "stock": -10
}

###

### 8. Eliminar producto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/2

###
